                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e3eadb2-be33-4bd2-942b-86da7ae2a6b9",
                                                "sense_id": "b6433e45-fd5a-3073-a729-e1dbe3307dd0",
                                                "text": "The “pussyhat” made its appearance around the country at the Women's Marches of January 21st."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "692a4ee3-1c0d-4490-af13-81864182ffb9",
                                                "sense_id": "b6433e45-fd5a-3073-a729-e1dbe3307dd0",
                                                "text": "So late last week the museum put out a call online seeking “pussyhat” donations — for a future exhibition and to create an archive of what the museum calls “the largest example of social activism through craft (\"craftivism\") in U.S. modern history.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a204315-1d0d-4693-bf8f-06d84374baa1",
                                                "sense_id": "b6433e45-fd5a-3073-a729-e1dbe3307dd0",
                                                "text": "Feminists are ditching the pink pussyhats during this year's Womens'^([sic]) Marches across the country for fear that they make some participants feel they aren't welcome."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06986e43-46b9-4c97-93e6-448a968b7447",
                                                "sense_id": "b6433e45-fd5a-3073-a729-e1dbe3307dd0",
                                                "text": "Pussyhats arose as an anti-Trump counterpart to the prefabricated “MAKE AMERICA GREAT AGAIN” hats and were featured prominently in the Women’s March of Jan. 21, 2017 – the largest single-day protest in U.S. history."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
